#: pop3.cc:245
#, qt-format
msgid "The server said: \"%1\""
msgstr "सर्भरले भन्यो :\"%1\""

#: pop3.cc:267
msgid "The server terminated the connection."
msgstr "सर्भरले जडान विच्छेद गर्यो"

#: pop3.cc:269
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Invalid response from server:\n"
"\"%1\""
msgstr ""
"सर्भरबाट अवैध प्रतिक्रिया:\n"
"\"%1\""

#: pop3.cc:296
msgid "Could not send to server.\n"
msgstr "सर्भरमा पठाउन सकेन ।\n"

#: pop3.cc:349 pop3.cc:408 pop3.cc:599
msgid "No authentication details supplied."
msgstr "प्रमाणीकरण विवरण प्रदान गरिएको छैन ।"

#: pop3.cc:386
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Login via APOP failed. The server %1 may not support APOP, although it "
"claims to support it, or the password may be wrong.\n"
"\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""
"APOP हुँदै लगइन गर्न असफल भयो । %1 सर्भरले APOP समर्थन नगर्न सक्दछ, यद्यपी यसले समर्थन "
"भएको दाबा गर्दछ वा पासवर्ड गलत हुनसक्दछ ।\n"
"\n"
" %2"

#: pop3.cc:446
#, qt-format
msgid "An error occurred during authentication: %1"
msgstr ""

#: pop3.cc:568
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Login via SASL (%1) failed. The server may not support %2, or the password "
"may be wrong.\n"
"\n"
"%3"
msgstr ""
"SASL (%1) हुँदै लगइन गर्न असफल भयो । सर्भरले %2 समर्थन नगरेर वा पासवर्ड गलत हुन सक्छ।\n"
"\n"
"%3"

#: pop3.cc:577
msgid ""
"Your POP3 server does not support SASL.\n"
"Choose a different authentication method."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँको POP3 सर्भरले SASL समर्थन गर्दैन ।\n"
"फरक प्रमाणीकरण विधि छनोट गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: pop3.cc:585
msgid "SASL authentication is not compiled into kio_pop3."
msgstr "SASL प्रमाणीकरणले kio pop3 मा कम्पाइल गरेको छैन ।"

#: pop3.cc:617 pop3.cc:666
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Could not login to %1.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"%1 सँग लगइन हुन सकेन ।\n"
"\n"

#: pop3.cc:631
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Could not login to %1. The password may be wrong.\n"
"\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""
"%1 मा लगइन गर्न सकेन । पासवर्ड गलत हुन सक्छ ।\n"
"\n"
"%2"

#: pop3.cc:669
msgid "The server terminated the connection immediately."
msgstr "सर्भरले तुरून्त नै जडान विच्छेद गर्यो ।"

#: pop3.cc:670
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Server does not respond properly:\n"
"%1\n"
msgstr ""
"सर्भरले राम्रोसँग प्रतिक्रिया दिएको छैन:\n"
"%1\n"

#: pop3.cc:698
msgid ""
"Your POP3 server does not support APOP.\n"
"Choose a different authentication method."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँको POP3 सर्भरले APOP समर्थन गर्दैन ।\n"
"एउटा छुट्टै प्रमाणीकरण विधि रोज्नुहोस् ।"

#: pop3.cc:718
msgid ""
"Your POP3 server claims to support TLS but negotiation was unsuccessful. You "
"can disable TLS in KDE using the crypto settings module."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँको POP3 सर्भरले TLS समर्थन गर्न दावि गर्दछ तर सम्झौता असफल भयो । तपाईँले क्रिप्टो "
"सेटिङ मोड्युल प्रयोग गरेर केडीई मा TLS अक्षम बनाउन सक्नुहुन्छ ।"

#: pop3.cc:729
msgid ""
"Your POP3 server does not support TLS. Disable TLS, if you want to connect "
"without encryption."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँको POP3 सर्भरले TLS समर्थन गर्दैन । यदि तपाईँ गुप्तिकरण नगरिकन जडान गर्न चाहानुहुन्छ "
"भने TLS अक्षम पार्नुहोस् ।"

#: pop3.cc:738
msgid "Username and password for your POP3 account:"
msgstr "तपाईँको POP3 खाताका लागि प्रयोगकर्ता नाम र पासवर्ड:"

#: pop3.cc:935 pop3.cc:944 pop3.cc:1079
msgid "Unexpected response from POP3 server."
msgstr "POP3 सर्भरबाट अनपेक्षित प्रतिक्रिया"

#~ msgid "PASS <your password>"
#~ msgstr "PASS <your password>"
